The KDP Help Center content that `kdp wiki build` downloads belongs to Amazon.
It is fetched to your own machine for reference and is not distributed with
this software.

example/hamlet.txt is the Folger Shakespeare Library edition of Hamlet
(https://shakespeare.folger.edu/), edited by Barbara A. Mowat and Paul
Werstine with Michael Poston and Rebecca Niles, used under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 3.0 Unported licence (CC BY-NC 3.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0/). It is included as a formatting example only;
this project's MIT licence does not apply to it, and the example book built
from it is not for sale.
